        </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-xl bg-neutral-faded px-4 py-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between mt-4 max-md:hidden">
          <p class="text-sm"><span class="font-semibold">Ready to get started?</span> <Link href="#">Sign up for free</Link></p>
